<title>UK: EBRD in $10mln credit for Sverdlosk region bank.</title>
<headline>EBRD in $10mln credit for Sverdlosk region bank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development said in a statement that it had provided a $10 million credit line for UralPromstroybank, the largest in the Sverdlosk region of Russia.</p>
<p>The loan to Russia's 50th largest bank in terms of assets will be used to lend on to small and medium-size businesses in the region. -- David Chance, London Newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
